      "writtenOn": "2020-10-30T12:47:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is nothing to do with the difference between dex and jar. It is just that previously any boot jar that was defined by a dex_import module was completely ignored by this check. Switching to checking the dex means that if those modules contain packages that are not allowed and the build is not being built with SKIP_BOOT_JARS_CHECK\u003dtrue then the build will start failing.",
