      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. I didn\u0027t try previously because the XML output is far more verbose (60+MB XML for framework compared with \u003c1MB for this) and I wanted to minimize the Python changes as I don\u0027t know it very well.\n\nHowever, I tried as you suggested but it failed because of http://b/172042691. Once that has been fixed I will be happy to upload my local changes but would like to get this submitted first as it unblocks my work on dexpreopt.",
      "parentUuid": "234e7b69_3a2e940e",
